\nonumber f_{XY}(x,y) = \left\{
\begin{array}{l l}
cx^2y & \quad 0 \leq y \leq x \leq 1 \\
& \quad \\
0 & \quad \text{otherwise}
\end{array} \right.
\end{equation}
Find the constant c.

